                <pb facs="0511" n="407" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg407"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">362.1163 Watch Tower/16: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Berlin (Geist) to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-05-27T11:00:00+01:00">May 27, 1933—11
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 27—6:38 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring to Department’s telegram of May 15 [<hi rendition="#italic">18</hi>], 5
                    p.m., I made representations last week Ministry Interior on behalf of the Watch
                    Tower Bible Society. Matter being investigated through authorities German states
                    where activities have been forbidden. No decision reached yet. See my despatch
                    sent confidential May 22nd.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d285-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geist</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
